{
  "action": "question",
  "question_count": 1,
  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "What is the exact rule linking the number of jets allocated to training in a given year to the number of pilots trained and available by the end of year 2 (for example, does each training jet in year 1 produce one pilot by the end of year 2, and does each training jet in year 2 produce one pilot by the end of year 2)?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single specific rule or policy definition. Although the parenthetical contains two illustrative sub-questions, they are examples provided to clarify the single main request for the 'exact rule'. A user can answer the main question by stating the rule, which inherently addresses the examples."
}

